Data and third-party material
-----------------------------
* Kaggle Playground Series S6E9 competition data (CC BY 4.0) is NOT redistributed in this repository. Download it
  from https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/playground-series-s6e9 after accepting the competition rules.
* "EV Adoption Behavior and Range Anxiety" by itzzomkar (CC0-1.0),
  https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/itzzomkar/ev-adoption-behavior-and-range-anxiety
  Used as an unsupervised lookup table (and its labels as external data), never as extra training rows.
* "S6E9 Six Feature Views OOF Library" by megayak (CC0-1.0),
  https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/megayak/s6e9-six-feature-views-oof-library
  Its out-of-fold and test predictions are blended with our own legs; the files are not redistributed.
* The generator's purchase and range-anxiety recipes were reconstructed by Chris Deotte in the public notebook
  "Fable 5.1 - EDA - Original Data Insights" and are re-implemented here from their published formulas.
* RealMLP legs use pytabkit (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/dholzmueller/pytabkit

Competition conduct
-------------------
No hidden labels, no leaderboard probing or row-level inference from submissions, and no private sharing of code
with other participants were used. The code was published after the competition closed, as permitted by the rules.
Results files contain only our own predictions, summary statistics and search logs.
